# Android device tree for {{ device_info.brand }} {{ device_info.model }} ({{ device_info.codename }})

{% if sprd_profile %}
This Unisoc tree uses the `{{ sprd_profile.recovery_branch }}` TWRP source
branch for Android {{ sprd_profile.android_release }}. Build it with lunch
target `twrp_{{ device_info.codename }}{{ sprd_profile.lunch_suffix }}-eng`.
The required source overlay is under `prebuilt/sourcecode`; run `./patch.sh`
there before building and `./recovery.sh` after the build to restore the
original files.
{% if sprd_profile.copy_stock_selinux %}
The stock SELinux policy is retained as `prebuilt/sepolicy.stock`. The SPRD
builder compiles `tools/patch_stock_sepolicy.c` and runs
`tools/patch_stock_sepolicy.sh` automatically. For a local build, compile the
C helper against static `libsepol`, set `SEPOLICY_PATCHER` to the resulting
executable, then run the shell helper before building. Recovery switches the
SELinux enforcement sysfs node from its recovery-only init rc; the shared
vendor_boot command line is not changed.
{% endif %}
{% if sprd_profile.uses_sc27xx_haptics %}
The vendor ramdisk exposes an SC27XX vibrator, so the input haptics overlay is included.
{% endif %}
{% if sprd_profile.needs_legacy_drm %}
The UMS legacy DRM modeset overlay is included.
{% endif %}
{% if sprd_profile.uses_himax_touch %}
The vendor ramdisk exposes a Himax touchscreen module. The branch-neutral
Himax `minuitwrp/events.cpp` touch-release overlay is included.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

